000010* Tables with subscripts of every binary size, read and
000020* written in place (bug fixed 2026-11-24: a COMP subscript,
000030* and a PIC 9 item with no VALUE, broke the C# build).
000040 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000050 PROGRAM-ID. TABLES2.
000060 DATA DIVISION.
000070 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
000080 01 TBL.
000090    05 E           PIC 99 OCCURS 9.
000100 01 D1             PIC 9.
000110 01 H              PIC 9(4)      COMP.
000120 01 HS             PIC S9(4)     COMP.
000130 01 W              PIC 9(9)      COMP.
000140 01 L              PIC 9(18)     COMP.
000150 01 C5             PIC 9(4)      COMP-5.
000160 01 TOTAL          PIC 9(4)      COMP.
000170 01 BIG            PIC S9(9)     COMP VALUE -123456789.
000180 01 SHOW           PIC -9(9).
000190 PROCEDURE DIVISION.
000200 MAIN-PARA.
000210     PERFORM VARYING H FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL H > 9
000220        COMPUTE E(H) = H * H
000230     END-PERFORM
000240     DISPLAY "SQUARES " TBL
000250     MOVE 0 TO TOTAL
000260     PERFORM VARYING D1 FROM 9 BY -1 UNTIL D1 < 1
000270        ADD E(D1) TO TOTAL
000280     END-PERFORM
000290     DISPLAY "TOTAL   " TOTAL
000300     MOVE 2 TO HS
000310     MOVE 3 TO W
000320     MOVE 4 TO L
000330     MOVE 5 TO C5
000340     DISPLAY "PICKS   " E(HS) " " E(W) " " E(L) " " E(C5)
000350     ADD 1 TO E(HS) E(W)
000360     SUBTRACT E(HS) FROM E(L)
000370     DISPLAY "CHANGED " E(HS) " " E(W) " " E(L)
000380     MOVE E(9) TO H
000390     ADD H TO W
000400     COMPUTE L = W * 1000000000 + H
000410     DISPLAY "BINARY  " H " " W " " L
000420     MOVE BIG TO SHOW
000430     DISPLAY "SIGNED  " SHOW
000440     STOP RUN.
